{"type": "message", "id": "18b05bb5", "parentId": "18aa0191", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T10:51:03.221Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_46cfe4dca7ad492cb9b74f9d", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"NAEP 2022 grade 8 math scores by state list all states average\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 903,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c0542e70e8d340c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP Mathematics: State Average Scores\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c0542e70e8d340c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/mathematics/states/scores/?grade=8\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cfd516cae1d15afc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo compare average mathematics scores between states/jurisdictions and the nation (public), <strong>use the NAEP State Profiles Tool</strong>. ... In the 43 states/jurisdictions where scores were lower in 2022 than 2019, the size of the score differences ranged from 2 to 14 points.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cfd516cae1d15afc\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nationsreportcard.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8729be49eed15da3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP Mathematics: State Student Group Scores\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8729be49eed15da3\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/mathematics/states/groups/?grade=8\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"aec568c5790ab4af\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUse the drop-down menu to select a state/jurisdiction and click on a student group thumbnail to see average mathematics scores for fourth-grade public school students over time in the selected state/jurisdiction. ... Use the drop-down menus to select a state/jurisdiction and a student group to view changes in the percentage distribution for that group over time. Read about changes in NAEP&#x27;s reporting for racial/ethnic groups.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"aec568c5790ab4af\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nationsreportcard.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0e0493644ba6ccb2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 MATHEMATICS STATE SNAPSHOT REPORT NATION  GRADE 8  PUBLIC SCHOOLS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0e0493644ba6ccb2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/subject/publications/stt2022/pdf/2023011NP8.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3683146dfd4d94bd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP ACHIEVEMENT-LEVEL PERCENTAGES AND AVERAGE SCORE\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3683146dfd4d94bd\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nces.ed.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cbd5ec04b433fc8f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStates With the Highest NAEP Math Scores | U.S. News Best States\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cbd5ec04b433fc8f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.usnews.com/news/best-states/rankings/education/prek-12/naep-math-scores\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"328853ff2f438c9e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nU.S. News ranks states based on NAEP math scores. See which states&#x27; eighth-graders are the best at math.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"328853ff2f438c9e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.usnews.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ff244b6993d33b67\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP Report Card: 2022 NAEP Mathematics Assessment\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ff24