{"type": "message", "id": "46b1804b", "parentId": "0b67cb77", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T10:53:12.001Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_2496491dc742465b898b34d9", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"NAEP 2022 grade 8 math state rankings list 1st 50th Massachusetts New Jersey Maryland\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 979,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8ddcbecef1a0fd0c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP Mathematics: State Average Scores\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8ddcbecef1a0fd0c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/mathematics/states/scores/?grade=8\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e9e3c3e9fd59e89c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe table below shows the number of states/jurisdictions with score increases or decreases in 2022 and how many states/jurisdictions scored higher, lower, or not significantly different than the nation (public) in NAEP mathematics.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e9e3c3e9fd59e89c\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nationsreportcard.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"81eb0f80295c9402\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStates With the Highest NAEP Math Scores | U.S. News Best States\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"81eb0f80295c9402\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.usnews.com/news/best-states/rankings/education/prek-12/naep-math-scores\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"68b3ff4c15f7b2ca\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nU.S. News ranks states based on NAEP math scores. See which states&#x27; eighth-graders are the best at math.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"68b3ff4c15f7b2ca\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.usnews.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"97a7f896dfef4dd9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP State and District Snapshots\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"97a7f896dfef4dd9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/snapshots/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d869d54d622ac8c9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe NAEP assessment results for states/jurisdictions and TUDA districts are available in mathematics, reading, science, and writing, and years assessed range from 2002-2024. TUDA district data collection began in 2002 with six districts participating and has expanded to twenty-eight districts participating over the years.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d869d54d622ac8c9\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nces.ed.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e2119e7468aeaf3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 NAEP Mathematics Assessment: Highlighted Results at Grades 4 and 8 for the Nation, States, and Districts | IES\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e2119e7468aeaf3\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/use-work/resource-library/report/statistical-analysis-report/2022-naep-mathematics-assessment-highlighted-results-grades-4-and-8-nation-states-and-districts\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"13350083a68e02de\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThis report presents selected results from the National Assessment of Educational Progress (NAEP) 2022 mathematics assessment. The report includes national, state, and district results on the performance of fourth- and eighth-grade students. Results are presented in terms of average scores ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"13350083a68e02de\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nces.ed.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \