"83db78d23b819a85\">>>", "url": "https://nces.ed.gov/programs/digest/d23/tables/dt23_222.70.asp", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e22415a1bc8860a4\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nPrevious Page Download Excel (38KB)\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e22415a1bc8860a4\">>>", "siteName": "nces.ed.gov"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9fdecf26038b3fa8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nStates With the Highest NAEP Math Scores | U.S. News Best States\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9fdecf26038b3fa8\">>>", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/best-states/rankings/education/prek-12/naep-math-scores", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4fdc57f00307bd5d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nU.S. News ranks states based on NAEP math scores. See which states&#x27; eighth-graders are the best at math.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4fdc57f00307bd5d\">>>", "siteName": "www.usnews.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"30935217cc3fcdeb\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNAEP Report Card: 2022 NAEP Mathematics Assessment\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"30935217cc3fcdeb\">>>", "url": "https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/highlights/mathematics/2022/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d25fc812eef75153\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nBetween January and March 2022, the National Assessment of Educational Progress (NAEP) mathematics assessment was administered to representative samples of fourth- and eighth-grade students in the nation. Results for the nation reflect the performance of students attending public schools, private schools, Bureau of Indian Education schools, and Department of Defense schools. Results are also available for the 50 states, the District of Columbia, Puerto Rico, and 26 participating districts.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d25fc812eef75153\">>>", "siteName": "www.nationsreportcard.gov"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775300017118}}
